	<string>Aircast can stream this device's camera as a video source.</string>
	<key>NSHighResolutionCapable</key>
	<true/>
	<key>NSLocalNetworkUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Aircast talks MAVLink and receives video from vehicles on your local network.</string>
	<key>NSLocationUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Aircast shows your position on the map and can send it to the vehicle for Follow Me and as the ground station location.</string>
